      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-2",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "An early access code is a one-time invite code: it works…",
      "text": "An early access code is a one-time invite code: it works for one account and admits that account to the app. It does not grant access to another team’s workspace or private files.",
