      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "A workspace is your team’s home. Put team-wide guidance at…",
      "text": "A workspace is your team’s home. Put team-wide guidance at the workspace root. Use a product for shared work across related projects, and a project for more specific work such as web, iOS, or marketing.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
